diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 286f85b..3a26d92 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -18,6 +18,14 @@ Unreleased
 - Never look at the `X-Forwarded-For` header, always use `request.remote_addr`,
   requiring the developer to configure `ProxyFix` appropriately. #700
 - Remove `LOGIN_DISABLED` config. #697
+- `login_user()` now removes existing `SESSION_KEYS` before writing the new
+  login state. This prevents values such as `next` and `_remember_seconds` from
+  being inherited by another user. Views using `USE_SESSION_FOR_NEXT` should
+  read or pop `next` before calling `login_user()`.
+- BREAKING: `login_user()` now defaults to `fresh=False`. Interactive views that
+  have just verified a password or another full credential should pass
+  `fresh=True` explicitly. This avoids marking SSO callbacks and server-side
+  session reconstruction as freshly authenticated by accident.
 
 
 Version 0.6.3
